 would love to see you draw PUMPKA!\n\nPUMPKA is a virtual pumpkin! She is partly a computer based artificial intelligence (from NOKIA 3310 phone) and partly a pumpkin plant. PUMPKA is energetic, happy and laughs a lot. She loves Halloween and spooky things. \n\nCould you draw PUMPKA in a frog costume? Similar to the one in refence folder. Thank you!\n\nThe art can be used on SNS, Twitter, Twitch and YouTube with credit. Thank you for your consideration! ♡\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JStGDJxqHKDEXfB47VZ-gACMpl0Y_7YL?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@suu_tsuu/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8934a7b4/uploads/origins/4ff2277e-7f88-4952-b821-d8cdbb3a37c0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7fba4cb3c94045a71e9c09045b23977e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8934a7b4/uploads/origins/4ff2277e-7f88-4952-b821-d8cdbb3a37c0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7fba4cb3c94045a71e9c09045b23977e, https://si.imgix.net/8934a7b4/uploads/origins/4ff2277e-7f88-4952-b821-d8cdbb3a37c0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31b4b18a84d028766dabeab00c59abfa 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8934a7b4/uploads/origins/4ff2277e-7f88-4952-b821-d8cdbb3a37c0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2e1dde830ab04dd329a537a8bd61dd1b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "伊野尾さん、アピールありがとうございます\n自分が楽しいと思うものを信じて描きます。\n私のキャラのメイン衣装を描いていただけると嬉しいです。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/njkAnIi", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@suu_tsuu/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8781daf3/uploads/origins/806ba1f5-c2cb-467a-9f83-36f7afc1e1e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=342cca04d4fbaa704c510cdcf9192a5d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8781daf3/uploads/origins/806ba1f5-c2cb-467a-9f83-36f7afc1e1e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompre